      "side": 1,
      "message": "llvm-ar is deterministic by default, the \u0027D\u0027 flag is undocumented. (tools/llvm-ar/llvm-ar.cpp) Nevertheless, I will add the flag back to the argument list.\n\n\u0027P\u0027 flag is for compatibility with archives created with other archivers. Since we\u0027re switching to llvm-ar globally, this should not matter.",
